    {
      "abstract": "Harmonised parametric LCOE model: cost functions C(d, h, P), Weibull energy module, multi-phase DCF. All harmonisation decisions (A1–A6) documented in the module docstring. Reproduces the paper’s deterministic results (reference LCOE 124.76 €/MWh; Tables 1, D2). Uncertainty analysis: PERT input distributions (paper Table C1), common-market-factor and Gaussian-copula correlations, Monte Carlo (N = 50,000), Sobol variance decomposition (Saltelli sampling). Reproduces Sections 3.3–3.4 and Appendices B–C. Source spreadsheet implementation underlying the model (distance-scenario workbook of the first author’s MSc dissertation). The Python model replicates it exactly at matching assumptions; departures are the documented corrections of paper Appendix A. Step-by-step configuration protocol for the System Advisor Model cross-validation (paper Appendix D). SAM 2026.7.3 project file used for the validation runs reported in paper Appendix D. Companion to the article submitted to Renewable Energy.",
